on fromnow
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 83 ........................... <the keyCode>
  [  5] pushcons 0 .............................. <"49">
  [  7] eq ...................................... <the keyCode = "49">
  [  8] jmpifz [ 24] ............................ if the keyCode = "49" then / else
  [ 11] pushsymb 66 ............................. <#stop>
  [ 14] pushint16 1 ............................. <1>
  [ 17] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1>
  [ 19] extcall 12 .............................. sound stop 1
  [ 21] jmp [ 29]
  [ 24] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 26] extcall 88 .............................. nothing()
  [ 29] ret
end
